# Party banter in the Amber Temple and on the ice stair below it. Each node opens with an `if` gate; the game plays
# an eligible node at a quiet moment, once each. Pregen voices: docs/voice/{ilse_varga, tamsin_tealeaf,
# hedda_ironvow, silvain_aster}.md. Class, species and tag lines are written so any such character could say them.

~ banter_thin_air
if visited:amber_temple_entrance and not flag.amber_milestone_given
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: I can't feel my ears. Can anyone else feel their ears? Ilse, are my ears still on?
interject name:ilse_varga: Both of them. I counted.
interject name:silvain_aster: The air up here is roughly two thirds of what you're used to. That's why your head hurts. Also because Tamsin hasn't stopped talking since the pass.
endif
-> END

~ banter_voices
if flag.amber_voices_begun and not flag.amber_temple_sealed and not flag.dark_gifts_taken
interject tag:devout: They're not lying. That's the worst of it. Every one of them tells you the price.
interject tag:blunt: A man who tells you the price is still selling.
interject tag:curious: I keep thinking about the eyes one. Not to take it. Just thinking about it.
interject tag:devout: That's how it starts, my friend. Thinking about it is the first step on the stair.
endif
-> END

~ banter_gift_taken
if flag.dark_gifts_taken >= 1 and not flag.amber_milestone_given
interject tag:devout: It's done, and it doesn't come undone. So we carry it together. Nobody carries a thing like that alone in this company.
interject tag:loyal: Agreed. Whoever it is, they're still ours.
interject tag:curious: Does it... feel like anything?
endif
-> END

~ banter_many_gifts
if flag.dark_gifts_taken >= 3
interject tag:blunt: Three. We've taken three. I said one would be too many, and here we are at three.
interject tag:proud: Strength is strength. The devil didn't climb down from this mountain with good manners either.
interject tag:devout: No. He climbed down with a dead brother. Mind where you put your feet.
endif
-> END

~ banter_lich
if flag.exethanter_met and not flag.exethanter_destroyed
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: I like him. Is it wrong that I like him? He's a lich. He's adorable.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: He's a warden who forgot his post. I've known abbots like that. They are always charming, right up until the roof falls in.
interject name:silvain_aster: He keeps the vault's password on his sleeve. I have never felt so professionally insulted and so personally fond at the same time.
endif
-> END

~ banter_jackal
if flag.vosk_suspected and not flag.vosk_fate and not flag.vosk_destroyed
interject class:cleric: The scholar in the library has a jackal's shadow. I'd like us all to remember that when he offers to help.
interject class:rogue: He offered me a book. Free. Nobody gives you a book for free. Not even in a library. Especially not in a library.
endif
-> END

~ banter_pact
if flag.strahd_pact_known
interject tag:bookish: A life he loved, on the day he most wanted to be happy. The terms read like a wedding vow turned inside out.
interject tag:blunt: He and the land are one thing. Then we take the land back from him a piece at a time, and see which one bleeds.
interject tag:devout: Or we bring the dawn to all of it at once. Dawn comes.
endif
-> END

~ banter_sealed
if flag.amber_temple_sealed
interject tag:devout: Listen. Nothing. For the first time since the stair, nothing at all.
interject tag:curious: I miss the eyes one a little.
interject tag:blunt: You'll get over it.
endif
-> END

~ banter_kasimir
if guest:kasimir_velikov and flag.kasimir_at_peace
interject guest:kasimir_velikov: She told me to be brave somewhere she can't see me. I think she meant the castle. I think she meant you.
interject tag:loyal: Then you're with us. Good.
endif
-> END

~ banter_kasimir_bargain
if guest:kasimir_velikov and flag.kasimir_bargain == "made"
interject guest:kasimir_velikov: One year. It is strange, how much longer a year feels when you can count it.
interject tag:devout: Then we spend it well. Every day of it.
endif
-> END

~ banter_hollow_gift
if gift:gift_of_the_hollow
interject tag:devout: One of us lay down in the devil's own coffin. I want us to say that out loud, once, so none of us can pretend later.
interject tag:blunt: Said. Heard. Now we watch them. Every night.
endif
-> END
